docs {
  # Create Form Template - School Default Status

  Example of creating a form template with status='school_default'.

  School default forms are the standard forms that are assigned to all
  students in the school by default.

  **Status**: 'school_default'

  **Note**: This is also the default status when no status is provided.
}

